#: rc.cpp:68
msgid "JavaScript Errors"
msgstr "JavaScript-Fehlers"

#: rc.cpp:69
msgid ""
"This dialog provides you with notification and details of scripting errors "
"that occur on web pages.  In many cases it is due to an error in the web "
"site as designed by its author.  In other cases it is the result of a "
"programming error in Konqueror.  If you suspect the former, please contact "
"the webmaster of the site in question.  Conversely if you suspect an error "
"in Konqueror, please file a bug report at http://bugs.kde.org/.  A test case "
"which illustrates the problem will be appreciated."
msgstr ""
"Düt Dialoog gifft jüm Bescheed un ok akkrate Informatschon vun "
"Scriptfehlers, welk op Websieten passern. Allmeist is dat, wiel Fehlers vun "
"de Autors vunne Websiet inboot sünd. Sünst is dat een Programmeerfehler in "
"Konqueror. Wenn Se denkt, dat de Fehler in de Websiet is, informeert Se den "
"Minsch, de de Websiet bedrievt. Wenn Se denken, dat de Fehler in Konqueror "
"is, schrievt Se doch bidde een Leckbericht an http://bugs.de.org/.  Schöön "
"is een Bispeel, wo man dat Problem bekieken kann."

